@startuml
[*] --> Monitoring Inventory Levels
Monitoring Inventory Levels --> [*]

Monitoring Inventory Levels --> Inventory Below Threshold : Inventory level < threshold
Inventory Below Threshold --> Reordering Inventory : Reorder inventory
Reordering Inventory --> Monitoring Inventory Levels : Update inventory levels

Monitoring Inventory Levels --> Generating Inventory Report : Generate report
Generating Inventory Report --> Monitoring Inventory Levels : Return to monitoring

Monitoring Inventory Levels --> [*] : System shutdown
@enduml
